+ * Continuous step "lane" background (方案A: 背景连续、块仍分明).
+ *
+ * Each content-type step-type record paints its --step-lane colour through a
+ * z-index:-1 ::before underlay that overflows ±7px vertically. Because
+ * .history-detail uses gap:14px between sibling records, two adjacent records
+ * of the SAME step each overflow 7px into the 14px gap and meet edge-to-edge
+ * at the gap mid-line, so the lane colour reads as one continuous band across
+ * the whole step region instead of a stack of disconnected islands. The
+ * records' own bubbles / cards / tool markers keep their borders and higher-
+ * alpha backgrounds untouched, so the blocks stay individually distinct.
